1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,870
Aap notice karte honge ki bahut sare log

2
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:04,540
bahut under confident hote hain.

3
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:06,830
Unko confidence nahi hota hai apne andar.

4
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:10,960
Lekin aap pattern notice karoge un logon ka jo

5
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,900
bahut jyada confidence hota hai jinke andar.

6
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:14,730
To dekho basically

7
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:18,060
jinke andar bhi confidence hota hai na

8
