11
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:33,720
To jitni jyada clarity apne aap ko apne vision

12
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:35,080
ko lekar ke hoga,

13
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:37,100
jitne jyada aapke thoughts clear honge,

14
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:40,750
utni hi jyada siddat se aap apni chijo ko execute

15
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:44,800
karoge aur aap jab chijo ko execute karne lag jate ho to self doubt aur fear apne aap side ho jata hai aur yahin se aapko confidence milta hai yahin se aap confidence gain karte ho life mein.
